    "rules": [
      "A backlog item or spec is not a capability.",
      "Unknown job types fail closed.",
      "No EXTERNAL_WRITE capability may be enabled until the bounded read-only reliability gate is accepted through authenticated runtime evidence and independent QA, and the specific write capability has a separate owner-approved write gate.",
      "DRAFT_ONLY may create an internal draft artifact but may not send, publish, reply, forward, or notify externally.",
      "DESTRUCTIVE capabilities require an explicit per-action owner gate and are never autonomous by default.",
      "A capability that can carry PII must define an approved retention and minimization contract before activation.",
      "Plugin-derived jobs must bind role_id, plugin_version, contract_version and SHA-256 at enqueue time and verify the same contract before execution.",
      "ZERO-COST-FIRST: deterministic and free/local execution precede any paid inference; no automatic paid fallback is permitted.",
      "Semantic READ_ONLY jobs may enter WAITING_FREE_AI without consuming a retry when no explicitly zero-cost provider is available.",
      "Official paid provider endpoints must never be admitted to the free-AI router solely because their model weights are open source."
    ]
